{{Phylacterynotes
| name = Planar Pocket
| desc = Does not proc [[Empower Spell]] on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.<br><br>[[Spell Redirection]] sources cause [[Empower Spell]] to proc on {{H|Spirit Breaker}} instead.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Planar Pocket
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Spirit Breaker|Nether Strike}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Planar Pocket icon0}}
| desc = Barathrum gains magic resistance and distorts reality around the selected hero, making any unit-targeted spells cast by enemy heroes get redirected towards Spirit Breaker. Can be cast on both allied and enemy heroes, but only spells cast by enemies of Spirit Breaker will be redirected.
}}
* Neither Blocks nor Redirects the following abilities:
** {{A|Bottle|Regenerate}}
** {{A|Lifestealer|Infest}} and its {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}}
** {{A|Marci|Rebound}}
** {{A|Io|Tether}}
** {{A|Morphling|Morph}}
** {{A|Rubick|Spell Steal}}
** {{A|Town Portal Scroll|Teleport}}<br/><br/>

* Neither Blocks nor Redirects if ground targeted the following abilities:
** {{A|Earth Spirit|Boulder Smash}}
** {{A|Gleipnir|Eternal Chains}}
** {{A|Meepo|Poof}}
** {{A|Nature's Prophet|Wrath of Nature}}
** {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}}<br/><br/>

* Neither Blocks nor Redirects from secondary targets the following multiple target abilities:
** {{A|Bane|Brain Sap}} {{Symbol|Aghshard}}
** {{A|Dazzle|Poison Touch}}
** {{A|Lion|Finger of Death}} {{Symbol|Aghanim}}
** {{A|Nyx Assassin|Mind Flare}} {{Symbol|bonus t4r}}
** {{A|Night Stalker|Void}} {{Symbol|Aghshard}}
** {{A|Phantom Assassin|Stifling Dagger}} {{Symbol|bonus t4l}}
** {{A|Skywrath Mage|Arcane Bolt}} {{Symbol|Aghshard}}
** {{A|Skywrath Mage|Ancient Seal}} {{Symbol|Aghanim}}
** {{A|Visage|Soul Assumption}} {{Symbol|bonus t2l}}<br/><br/>

* Neither Blocks nor Redirects regardless of unit or groud targeted:
** {{A|Dragon Knight|Breathe Fire}}
** {{A|Death Prophet|Crypt Swarm}}
** {{A|Jakiro|Dual Breath}}
** {{A|Kez|Kazurai Katana}}
** {{A|Lina|Dragon Slave}}
** {{A|Lion|Earth Spike}}
** {{A|Troll Warlord|Whirling Axes (Ranged)}}<br/>

* Blocks and Redirects if unit targeted the following abilities:
** {{A|Magnus|Shockwave}}
** {{A|Spectre|Spectral Dagger}} 
** {{A|Tidehunter|Gush}} {{Symbol|Aghanim}}<br/><br/>

* Blocks, but does not Redirects the following abilities:
** {{A|Lycan|Wolf Bite}}
** {{A|Snapfire|Gobble Up}}<br/>

* Blocks and Redirects the following abilities:
** {{A|Abaddon|Aphotic Shield}} [{{tooltip|?|Shield instantly explodes}}]
** {{A|Centaur Warrunner|Hitch a Ride}}
** {{A|Phoenix|Supernova}} {{Symbol|Aghanim}} <br/><br/>

* Blocks, but does not Redirects the following items:
** {{A|Clockwerk|Armor Power}}
*** {{I|Chainmail}} remains in the inventory.
** {{A|Moon Shard|Consume}}
*** The item remains in the inventory.
** {{I|Urn of Shadows}}-based item abilities
*** Item is put on cooldown, but charges are not spent.

* Blocks and Redirects the following items:
** {{A|Alchemist|Aghanim's Scepter Synth}}
*** The item remains in the inventory. Spirit Breaker recieves {{I|Aghanim's Blessing}}.
** {{A|Tango|Devour}}
*** The item remains in the inventory. Spirit Breaker recieves {{I|Tango (Shared)}}.

